 "dur": 45.0,
 "target": 45.0,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Captain Pim welded a giant steel ball onto his ship's nose.",
   "s": 0.12,
   "e": 3.297
  },
  {
   "text": "You see, the first ship to bring 1,000 crates to Port Vella gets paid double.",
   "s": 3.497,
   "e": 7.574
  },
  {
   "text": "Captain Brag laughed: \"Is that a cargo ship, or a clown nose?\"",
   "s": 7.774,
   "e": 10.797
  },
  {
   "text": "Out of the harbor, Brag's sleek ship shot ahead.",
   "s": 10.917,
   "e": 12.977
  },
  {
   "text": "Then came three legs. Leg one: Brag led by a mile.",
   "s": 13.177,
   "e": 15.963
  },
  {
   "text": "Leg two: full speed. A huge wave piled up on Brag's bow.",
   "s": 16.163,
   "e": 19.409
  },
  {
   "text": "Leg three: Brag pushed harder, so his fuel needle dropped and the wave grew.",
   "s": 19.609,
   "e": 23.101
  },
  {
   "text": "Then his engines coughed, and he drifted to a stop.",
   "s": 23.501,
   "e": 25.821
  },
  {
   "text": "Ever walked through waist-deep water? Pushing the water is the hard part.",
   "s": 26.021,
   "e": 29.426
  },
  {
   "text": "But Pim's ball makes its own wave: a dip right where the hump rises.",
   "s": 29.626,
   "e": 33.142
  },
  {
   "text": "Hump meets dip, the sea goes flat, and Pim burns up to fifteen percent less fuel.",
   "s": 33.342,
   "e": 37.399
  },
  {
   "text": "Brag waved from his drifting ship: \"Pim! Give me a tow!\"",
   "s": 37.599,
   "e": 40.277
  },
  {
   "text": "Pim threw a rope. The cat had tied a clown nose on it.",
   "s": 40.397,
   "e": 43.132
  }
 ],
